#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.desktop.in:3
#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Baseboard"
msgstr "Baseboard"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.desktop.in:4
#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:8
#: crates/app/src/application.rs:149
msgid "Monitor your motherboard sensors"
msgstr "Podgląd czujników płyty głównej"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.desktop.in:10
msgid "sensors;temperature;fan;voltage;hardware;motherboard;mainboard;RGB;"
msgstr ""
"czujniki;temperatura;wentylator;napięcie;sprzęt;płyta "
"główna;płyta;RGB;sensors;"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:7
msgid "Window width"
msgstr "Szerokość okna"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:11
msgid "Window height"
msgstr "Wysokość okna"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:15
msgid "Window maximized"
msgstr "Okno zmaksymalizowane"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:20
#: crates/app/src/preferences.rs:134
msgid "Refresh interval"
msgstr "Odświeżanie"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:21
msgid "Seconds between two readings of the sensors on the Overview page."
msgstr "Sekundy między dwoma odczytami czujników na stronie Przegląd."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:25
#: crates/app/src/preferences.rs:159
msgid "Names from lm-sensors"
msgstr "Nazwy z lm-sensors"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:26
msgid ""
"Name the readings as the sensors command does, where the lm-sensors "
"configuration gives a label."
msgstr ""
"Nazwy odczytów takie jak w poleceniu sensors, gdy konfiguracja lm-sensors "
"podaje etykietę."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:30
msgid "Hidden readings"
msgstr "Ukryte odczyty"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:31
msgid ""
"Readings not shown on the Overview page, as chip/channel@device, e.g. "
"nct6687/fan2@devices/platform/nct6683.2592."
msgstr ""
"Odczyty niepokazywane na stronie Przegląd, jako układ/kanał@urządzenie, np. "
"nct6687/fan2@devices/platform/nct6683.2592."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:35
msgid "Readings turned on"
msgstr "Włączone odczyty"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.gschema.xml:36
msgid ""
"Readings that are off until turned on, such as the numbered temperature "
"sensors of NVMe drives, and that are shown on the Overview page; as in the "
"hidden readings."
msgstr ""
"Odczyty domyślnie wyłączone, np. numerowane czujniki temperatury dysków "
"NVMe, które pokazywane są na stronie Przegląd; zapis jak w ukrytych "
"odczytach."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Baseboard shows the temperatures, fan speeds and voltages reported by your "
"motherboard, processor, graphics card, drives and memory, with the names of "
"the fan headers printed on the board."
msgstr ""
"Baseboard pokazuje temperatury, obroty wentylatorów i napięcia zgłaszane "
"przez płytę główną, procesor, kartę graficzną, dyski i pamięć, z nazwami "
"złączy wentylatorów nadrukowanymi na płycie."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"It also shows information about the board, BIOS, processor, memory, graphics "
"card and drives, and copies it as text for bug reports."
msgstr ""
"Pokazuje też informacje o płycie, BIOS-ie, procesorze, pamięci, karcie "
"graficznej i dyskach i kopiuje je jako tekst do zgłoszeń błędów."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"Later versions will also control fans, onboard RGB lighting and power "
"profiles."
msgstr ""
"Kolejne wersje będą też sterować wentylatorami, podświetleniem RGB płyty i "
"profilami energii."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:38
msgid "Readings named after the board’s fan headers and voltage rails"
msgstr "Odczyty nazwane według złączy wentylatorów i szyn napięć płyty"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:43
msgid "The board, BIOS, processor, memory and drives"
msgstr "Płyta, BIOS, procesor, pamięć i dyski"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:48
msgid "The readings in the dark style"
msgstr "Odczyty w ciemnym stylu"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:61
msgid ""
"The first release. Baseboard reads the sensors of a motherboard and shows "
"information about the system; it does not control anything yet."
msgstr ""
"Pierwsze wydanie. Baseboard odczytuje czujniki płyty głównej i pokazuje "
"informacje o systemie; jeszcze niczym nie steruje."

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:63
msgid ""
"Temperatures, fan speeds and voltages; on a board with a profile, named "
"after its fan headers and voltage rails"
msgstr ""
"Temperatury, obroty wentylatorów i napięcia; na płycie z profilem nazwane "
"według jej złączy wentylatorów i szyn napięć"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:64
msgid ""
"Voltages rated against their tolerance, with the lowest and highest value "
"since the app started"
msgstr ""
"Ocena napięć względem tolerancji, z najniższą i najwyższą wartością od "
"uruchomienia aplikacji"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:65
msgid ""
"A System page with the board, BIOS, processor, memory, graphics card, drives "
"and the fan driver, which can be copied as text for bug reports"
msgstr ""
"Strona System z płytą, BIOS-em, procesorem, pamięcią, kartą graficzną, "
"dyskami i sterownikiem wentylatorów, którą można skopiować jako tekst do "
"zgłoszeń błędów"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:66
msgid "English and Polish"
msgstr "Interfejs po angielsku i po polsku"

#: data/me.bojanowski.Baseboard.metainfo.xml.in:68
msgid "Fan control, onboard RGB lighting and power profiles are not there yet."
msgstr ""
"Sterowania wentylatorami, podświetlenia RGB płyty i profili energii jeszcze "
"nie ma."

#: crates/app/src/application.rs:129
msgid "The nct6683 driver of Linux and its documentation"
msgstr "Sterownik nct6683 w Linuksie i jego dokumentacja"

#: crates/app/src/application.rs:133
msgid "The hwmon sysfs interface of Linux"
msgstr "Interfejs sysfs hwmon w Linuksie"

#: crates/app/src/application.rs:138
msgid "OpenRGB issue reports on the RGB protocol"
msgstr "Zgłoszenia w OpenRGB opisujące protokół RGB"

#. Translators: your name and email, one translator per line.
#: crates/app/src/application.rs:153
msgid "translator-credits"
msgstr "Tomasz Bojanowski"

#: crates/app/src/application.rs:165
msgid "Hardware descriptions from public sources"
msgstr "Opis sprzętu ze źródeł publicznych"

#. Translators: {source} is a temperature, e.g. "CPU (board sensor)".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:322
#, rust-format
msgid "Temperature source: {source}."
msgstr "Źródło temperatury: {source}."

#. Translators: a point of a fan curve, e.g. "Point 3: 60 °C, 35 %."
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:328 crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:377
#, rust-format
msgid "Point {number}: {temperature}, {duty}."
msgstr "Punkt {number}: {temperature}, {duty}."

#. Translators: repeated points of a fan curve, e.g.
#. "Points 4–7: 85 °C, 100 %."
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:333
#, rust-format
msgid "Points {first}–{last}: {temperature}, {duty}."
msgstr "Punkty {first}–{last}: {temperature}, {duty}."

#. Translators: the source temperature and the fan's duty cycle
#. now, e.g. "Now 46.0 °C, duty cycle 38 %."
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:347
#, rust-format
msgid "Now {temperature}, duty cycle {duty}."
msgstr "Teraz {temperature}, wypełnienie {duty}."

#. Translators: the controller changes the duty cycle
#. gradually; {duty} is where it is heading, e.g. "40 %".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:357
#, rust-format
msgid "The fan is moving to {duty}."
msgstr "Wentylator dochodzi do {duty}."

#. Translators: the lowest duty cycle allowed for this fan, e.g. "30 %".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:365
#, rust-format
msgid "Minimum duty cycle: {duty}."
msgstr "Minimalne wypełnienie: {duty}."

#. Translators: the emergency temperature of the source, e.g. "95 °C".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:372
#, rust-format
msgid "Emergency threshold: {temperature}."
msgstr "Próg awaryjny: {temperature}."

#. Translators: the name of the chart for the screen reader;
#. {name} is a fan, e.g. "CPU fan 1".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:546
#, rust-format
msgid "Curve of {name}"
msgstr "Krzywa: {name}"

#. Translators: the title of the vertical axis of a fan curve.
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:792
msgid "Duty cycle"
msgstr "Wypełnienie"

#. Translators: the title of the horizontal axis of a fan curve;
#. {source} is a temperature, e.g. "CPU (board sensor)".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:801
#, rust-format
msgid "Temperature: {source}"
msgstr "Temperatura: {source}"

#. Translators: the zone of a fan curve below the lowest duty
#. cycle allowed; {duty} is e.g. "30 %".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:869
#, rust-format
msgid "Below the minimum of {duty}"
msgstr "Poniżej minimum {duty}"

#. Translators: the emergency temperature of the source on
#. a fan curve that must reach full duty by then; e.g.
#. "Emergency threshold 95 °C: 100 % from there".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:907
#, rust-format
msgid "Emergency threshold {temperature}: {duty} from there"
msgstr "Próg awaryjny {temperature}: od niego {duty}"

#. Translators: the emergency temperature of the source on
#. a fan curve, e.g. "Emergency threshold 95 °C".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:913
#, rust-format
msgid "Emergency threshold {temperature}"
msgstr "Próg awaryjny {temperature}"

#. Translators: the label of the operating point on a fan curve,
#. e.g. "Now 46.0 °C · 38 %".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:1033
#, rust-format
msgid "Now {temperature} · {duty}"
msgstr "Teraz {temperature} · {duty}"

#. Translators: under the label of the operating point, where
#. the fan is heading, e.g. "target 40 %".
#: crates/app/src/fan_chart.rs:1045
#, rust-format
msgid "target {duty}"
msgstr "cel {duty}"

#. Translators: the source of a fan curve when it is a temperature
#. the kernel driver does not report.
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:66
msgid "A temperature the driver does not report"
msgstr "Temperatura, której sterownik nie podaje"

#. Translators: the source of a fan curve when the controller
#. follows no temperature.
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:69
msgid "No temperature"
msgstr "Brak temperatury"

#. Translators: the source of a fan curve that follows several
#. temperatures at once; {list} is e.g. "temp1, temp2".
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:77
#, rust-format
msgid "Several temperatures: {list}"
msgstr "Kilka temperatur: {list}"

#. / The line on top of the page in version 0.2.0 at a driver that controls
#. / the fans, and the note of the curve page.
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:85
msgid "This version of Baseboard shows the fan settings without changing them."
msgstr ""
"Ta wersja Baseboard pokazuje ustawienia wentylatorów bez możliwości zmiany."

#. Translators: under the temperature source of the fan
#. curves, e.g. "nct6687 · temp1 · emergency threshold 95 °C".
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:159
#, rust-format
msgid "{chip} · {channel} · emergency threshold {temperature}"
msgstr "{chip} · {channel} · próg awaryjny {temperature}"

#. Translators: read by screen readers after the name of a
#. reading, e.g. "nct6687 · temp2. Now 37.5 °C".
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:190 crates/app/src/overview.rs:303
#, rust-format
msgid "{subtitle}. Now {value}"
msgstr "{subtitle}. Teraz {value}"

#. Translators: read by screen readers after the name of a
#. reading, e.g. "nct6687 · temp2. Now 37.5 °C, since start
#. 36.0–38.0 °C".
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:192 crates/app/src/overview.rs:308
#, rust-format
msgid "{subtitle}. Now {value}, since start {range}"
msgstr "{subtitle}. Teraz {value}, od uruchomienia {range}"

#. Translators: Baseboard cannot control the board's fans here.
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:452 crates/app/src/fans.rs:503
#: crates/app/src/system.rs:665
msgid "Fan control unavailable"
msgstr "Sterowanie wentylatorami niedostępne"

#. Translators: {} is the name of the board's chip, e.g. nct6687.
#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:464 crates/app/src/system.rs:672
#, rust-format
msgid "The board's {} chip was not found"
msgstr "Nie znaleziono układu płyty {}"

#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:480 crates/app/src/overview.rs:619
msgid "All readings are hidden"
msgstr "Wszystkie odczyty są ukryte"

#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:481 crates/app/src/overview.rs:620
msgid "Turn them on again in Preferences."
msgstr "Można je włączyć z powrotem w preferencjach."

#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:508
msgid ""
"Needs a newer kernel with the extended nct6683 driver. This driver does not "
"report the duty cycles of the system fans."
msgstr ""
"Wymaga nowszego jądra z rozszerzonym sterownikiem nct6683. Wypełnienia "
"wentylatorów systemowych ten sterownik nie podaje."

#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:512
msgid "Needs a newer kernel with the extended nct6683 driver."
msgstr "Wymaga nowszego jądra z rozszerzonym sterownikiem nct6683."

#: crates/app/src/fans.rs:590
msgid "The kernel driver does not support control of this header."
msgid_plural "The kernel driver does not support control of these headers."
msgstr[0] "Sterownik jądra nie obsługuje sterowania tym złączem."
msgstr[1] "Sterownik jądra nie obsługuje sterowania tymi złączami."
msgstr[2] "Sterownik jądra nie obsługuje sterowania tymi złączami."

#: crates/app/src/fans.ui:35 crates/app/src/overview.ui:39
msgid "Reading the sensors…"
msgstr "Odczyt czujników…"

#: crates/app/src/fans.ui:39 crates/app/src/overview.ui:25
#: crates/app/src/window.rs:396
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Szczegóły"

#: crates/app/src/fans.ui:85 crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:175
msgid "Temperature source"
msgstr "Źródło temperatury"

#: crates/app/src/fans.ui:86
msgid ""
"The board's controller computes the duty cycles of the curves from this "
"temperature."
msgstr "Według tej temperatury kontroler płyty liczy wypełnienie z krzywych."

#: crates/app/src/fans.ui:91
msgid "Headers"
msgstr "Złącza"

#: crates/app/src/fans.ui:92 crates/app/src/overview.rs:413
msgid "In the order of the headers on the board"
msgstr "W kolejności złączy na płycie"

#: crates/app/src/fans.ui:106 crates/app/src/system.rs:704
msgid "Read only"
msgstr "Tylko odczyt"

#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:308 crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:704
msgid "Automatic BIOS"
msgstr "Automat BIOS"

#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:309 crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:705
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "Ręczny"

#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:310
msgid "Curve"
msgstr "Krzywa"

#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:319
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Tryb"

#. Translators: in place of the mode switch of a fan
#. header whose channel nobody has checked on this
#. board.
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:340 crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:711
msgid "This header was not checked on this board."
msgstr "Złącza nie sprawdzono na tej płycie."

#. Translators: under the duty cycle of a fan in manual
#. mode, e.g. "45 %".
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:405
msgid "duty cycle"
msgstr "wypełnienie"

#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:425
msgid ""
"A curve in the board's controller sets the speed. This driver does not show "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Obroty ustala krzywa w kontrolerze płyty. Ten sterownik jej nie pokazuje."

#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:429
msgid "The curve could not be read from the board's controller."
msgstr "Nie udało się odczytać krzywej z kontrolera płyty."

#. Translators: after "No speed since the app started: the
#. header may be empty."; Readings is the page of the
#. Preferences dialog.
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:446
msgid "You can hide it in Preferences, on the Readings page."
msgstr "Ukryjesz je w Preferencjach, w zakładce Odczyty."

#. Translators: a button on a fan card that opens its curve.
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:463
msgid "Show Curve"
msgstr "Pokaż krzywą"

#. Translators: the duty cycle of a fan moving to the one
#. its curve gives, e.g. "duty 30 % → 38 %".
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:589
#, rust-format
msgid "duty {duty} → {target}"
msgstr "wypełnienie {duty} → {target}"

#. Translators: the duty cycle of a fan, e.g. "duty 49 %".
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:594 crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:661
#, rust-format
msgid "duty {duty}"
msgstr "wypełnienie {duty}"

#. Translators: under a fan card while the fan moves to the duty
#. cycle of its curve.
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:673
msgid "In automatic mode the controller changes the duty cycle gradually."
msgstr "W automacie kontroler zmienia wypełnienie stopniowo."

#. Translators: under a fan card in manual mode; {duty} is "0 %".
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:676
#, rust-format
msgid "{duty} stops the fan"
msgstr "{duty} zatrzymuje wentylator"

#. Translators: read by screen readers for the button that opens
#. the curve of a fan; {name} is the fan, e.g. "CPU fan 1".
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:686
#, rust-format
msgid "Show the curve of {name}"
msgstr "Pokaż krzywą: {name}"

#. Translators: read by screen readers on a fan card, e.g.
#. "mode: Automatic BIOS".
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:701
#, rust-format
msgid "mode: {mode}"
msgstr "tryb: {mode}"

#. / "No speed since the app started: the header may be empty."
#. Translators: on a fan card when the fan has not turned since
#. Baseboard started; nothing tells an empty header from a fan that
#. does not start.
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:729
msgid "No speed since the app started: the header may be empty."
msgstr "Brak obrotów od startu aplikacji: złącze może być puste."

#. Translators: the lowest duty cycle of a fan, e.g. "minimum 30 %".
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:740
#, rust-format
msgid "minimum {duty}"
msgstr "minimum {duty}"

#. Translators: nobody has yet checked on this board that the
#. reading belongs to this header.
#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:752
msgid "header not tested"
msgstr "złącze nietestowane"

#: crates/app/src/fans/card.rs:758
#, rust-format
msgid "source: {source}"
msgstr "źródło: {source}"

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:148
msgid "Points"
msgstr "Punkty"

#. Translators: under "Points" on the curve page in the preview.
#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:150
msgid "Values read from the board's controller."
msgstr "Wartości odczytane z kontrolera płyty."

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:187
msgid "Cannot be changed"
msgstr "Nie można zmienić"

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:192
msgid "How the curve works"
msgstr "Jak działa krzywa"

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:195
msgid "The duty cycle changes linearly between the points"
msgstr "Między punktami wypełnienie zmienia się liniowo"

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:196
msgid "Below the first point and above the last one their duty cycle holds."
msgstr ""
"Poniżej pierwszego punktu i powyżej ostatniego obowiązuje ich wypełnienie."

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:200
msgid "The board's controller runs the curve"
msgstr "Krzywą wykonuje kontroler płyty"

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:201
msgid "Neither the app nor the helper has to run for it."
msgstr "Aplikacja ani pomocnik nie muszą przy tym działać."

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:277
#, rust-format
msgid "{header} · preview"
msgstr "{header} · podgląd"

#. Translators: in the legend under a fan curve, the operating
#. point, e.g. "Now: 46.0 °C, 38 %".
#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:302
#, rust-format
msgid "Now: {temperature}, {duty}"
msgstr "Teraz: {temperature}, {duty}"

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:318
#, rust-format
msgid "Target: {duty}"
msgstr "Cel: {duty}"

#. Translators: under the list of points of a curve, e.g.
#. "Point 7 is the same as point 6."
#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:395
#, rust-format
msgid "Point {last} is the same as point {first}."
msgstr "Punkt {last} jest taki sam jak punkt {first}."

#. Translators: under the list of points of a curve, e.g.
#. "Points 5–7 are the same as point 4."
#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:400
#, rust-format
msgid "Points {from}–{last} are the same as point {first}."
msgstr "Punkty {from}–{last} są takie same jak punkt {first}."

#: crates/app/src/fans/curve_page.rs:407
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"The controller has {} point, and a curve with fewer levels repeats the last "
"one."
msgid_plural ""
"The controller has {} points, and a curve with fewer levels repeats the last "
"one."
msgstr[0] ""
"Kontroler ma {} punkt, a krzywa z mniejszą liczbą poziomów powtarza ostatni."
msgstr[1] ""
"Kontroler ma {} punkty, a krzywa z mniejszą liczbą poziomów powtarza ostatni."
msgstr[2] ""
"Kontroler ma {} punktów, a krzywa z mniejszą liczbą poziomów powtarza "
"ostatni."

#: crates/app/src/overview.rs:29 crates/app/src/system.rs:362
msgid "Processor"
msgstr "Procesor"

#: crates/app/src/overview.rs:30 crates/app/src/system.rs:265
